WEBVTT

NOTE
FloorLogic demo — descriptions. The real FloorLogic app, filmed with fictional sample data
(Pinyon Flooring Co.). Each cue starts with the caption burned into the video; action counts are
the real clicks, taps and dates made while filming. Written by tools/video/comp/publish-meta.mjs.

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.830
Pick a survey date — the lead moves itself. On the Leads list, new lead Hannah Brooks is open in the side panel. A site-survey date (10/16/2026) is typed in the panel; the app moves the lead to Site Survey Scheduled — the panel's stage, the lead's status in the list and the stage counts below (New 2, Site Survey Scheduled 4) — and adds a survey task. 1 click · 1 date.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.730
And it’s on your phone. The FloorLogic phone app's Today screen lists Hannah Brooks under Surveys coming up.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.720
Type the area — whole cartons, carpet cuts and tax figured for you. In quote QT-330 the floor section is marked Pick One (good / better / best) and a 912 sq ft job area is applied: 39 cartons = 927.03 sq ft for the first option. The optional carpet stairs read 19.33 sq yd — a 14' 6" cut off a 12' roll. Quote total: tax 8.265%, grand total $7,571.93. Privacy Mode then blurs cost and margin. 7 clicks · typed 912.

4
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:23.700
They pick Better, add the stairs and approve — from their phone. On the customer's quote link the Better floor is picked, the carpeted stairs are added (total $8,624.70) and Approve Quote is tapped. The quote shows APPROVED and locks. 3 taps.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.120
One click makes the work order and invoice. In the office, approved quote QT-330 shows Create WO & Invoice; the app asks to confirm and creates work order WO-330 and invoice IN-330. 2 clicks.

6
00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:33.700
Order the materials, book the install. Work order WO-330: Order Materials, select all, Finish — 4 purchase orders are marked ordered and the work order moves to Ready to Schedule. Schedule Install: start October 21, end October 22, installer Ruben Ortiz — Scheduled. 9 clicks · 2 dates.

7
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.720
Balance paid by check — recorded in a few clicks. On invoice IN-330: Take Payment (the balance, $4,312.35, is filled in), method Check, check number 2318, Record Payment. Paid in Full — the invoice reads Balance Due $0.00. 5 clicks · typed 2318.

8
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.520
Estimate vs actual, margin and profit — ready when the job is. Job costing for WO-330: revenue $8,184.07, estimated cost $4,883.79, actual $5,072.92 (+$189.13 over), margin 38.0% before commission, profit $2,862.25 after commission. 1 click.

9
00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:45.400
FloorLogic. Start your free 14-day trial. No credit card · No setup fee. floorlogic.vercel.app
